  "title": "Extended Bloch group and the Cheeger–Chern–Simons class Walter D Neumann",
  "authors_raw": "Department of Mathematics, Barnard College",
  "abstract": "We deﬁne an extended Bloch group and show it is naturally isom orphic to H3(PSL(2, C)δ; Z). Using the Rogers dilogarithm function this leads to an ex- act simplicial formula for the universal Cheeger–Chern–Si mons class on this homology group. It also leads to an independent proof of the a nalytic relation- ship between volume and Chern–Simons invariant of hyperbol ic 3–manifolds conjectured in [16] and proved in [24], as well as eﬀective for mulae for the Chern–Simons invariant of a hyperbolic 3–manifold.",
